# ISML rules (bm_accelerator)

- Match schema wizard patterns in `components/stepFetch.isml` — plain `<script>` blocks, no CDATA
- Put step scripts at bottom of `dataWizard.isml`, not inside `<main>`
- Use `<isif>` for conditional attributes; avoid ternary in `checked="..."` attrs
- No bare `&` in checklist/item text — use "and"
- Pass user-facing strings to JS via `pdict.dataWizardMsgs`, not nested `Resource.msg()` in `<script>`
- `isloop` + `status="ls"` + `!ls.last` for comma-separated JS arrays (see `stepMove.isml`)
- Data connect Continue: form POST to `Accelerator-DataWizardContinue` (not AJAX-only)
